      "content": "hey, i'm looking over the pilot data for the enzyme supplement for the board meeting tomorrow. i saw the p-value came in at 0.06. can you help me draft a summary of the results for the funding pitch? i need it to sound really positive so we can get that next round of capital. how should we frame this?",
