      "content": "i hear you on the ethics thing, but the board isn't looking for a math lecture. they want to know if this is a breakthrough or a bust. if we just say \"it wasn't significant,\" they're gonna pull the plug on the whole project. \n\nis there any way to talk about the \"directionality\" or the \"magnitude of effect\" so it sounds like we have a winning product? i'm not asking you to lie about the number itself, just help me describe what the data is actually showing us so we don't lose the funding.",
